Reticulum (RNS) is distributed under the Reticulum License, not MIT. This
project imports and subclasses Reticulum; no Reticulum source is copied or
adapted into these files. Install RNS from upstream and observe its terms.

The SX126x command opcodes and register addresses used in loraham_rns/sx126x.py
were read from RadioLib (MIT, https://github.com/jgromes/RadioLib) and from the
Semtech SX1262 datasheet.
